{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的音乐感受明显不如X细腻，许多具体的音型变化、情绪转折和层层递进的感受被压缩成了概括性词组。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左侧叙述更连贯，人物每一步为什么想念、为什么犹豫、为什么改变决定，都能顺着完整句子直接理解；右侧感受词则提供了快速补充，整体更容易边听边跟住故事。X凭借重点高亮和按音乐时点出现的感受词，在抓取段落重点和呈现细腻音乐变化方面更有优势，但信息层次切换较多，容易让观众忙于追踪屏幕上的细节。综合普通观众的实际观看体验，我选Y，但X在音乐感受的具体性和丰富度上确实胜出。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b1c908c4-9670-43a3-add0-cedae93d700e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T172644514907Z", "elapsed_seconds": 76.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T17:28:01.102476+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c8c628233793fe8a00f7596df8b34db51ff2fde098cc5e9e87981f5b27daa4e3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g